  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Emergency Medical Preparedness &amp; Engagement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment funds the National Critical Care and Trauma Response Centre (NCCTRC) to strengthen disaster medical preparedness and response capacity in the Indo-Pacific region.  Funding supports the provision of disaster medicine training to medical professionals from the Indo-Pacific region (in Australia and in-country). Funding under this investment also supports the World Health Organization (WHO) led Emergency Medical Team (EMT) initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
